  "details": "Discord recently added a Timeout feature.\n\nIt lets you moderate a user by letting them stay in your server, but not letting them post or interact with anything.\n\nA similar feature would be useful for VRChat Groups.\n\nI may not want to kick or ban a long-term member, but may need to set them to timeout temporarily.\n\nHere's a list of what's needed:\n\n1. Timeout feature that temporarily prevents a user from interacting with the group in any way.\n\n2. A duration of the timeout moderators can set. (5 minutes, 30 minutes, hours, 1 day, 3 days, 1 week, 1 month, etc.)\n\n3. A reason for the timeout (text box).\n\n4. Logs that record which Moderator issued the Timeout, with the datetime, duration, and reason.",
